<title>UK: London tea sale average price.</title>
<headline>London tea sale average price.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average for the 5,450 packages of landed tea sold at this weeks London sale was 119.96 pence a kilo against 118.48 last week and 116.04 a year ago.</p>
<p>The average for the 289,932 pkgs sold so far this year is 113.36 pence against 103.23 pence for the 412,692 pkgs sold by this stage last year.</p>
